  "description": "Cruisers -- the simple, approachable bike that are grab 'n go, nothing needed other than the ability to pedal. E-bikes -- the way of the future. Cruiser e-bike? Yep, the ultimate. And that's exactly what the Shoreliner i/O is: the approachable, simple, grab-'n-go e-bike with high-tech features available in a no-tech-necessary manner of simplicity. It's ready to make your life easier. Just grab, and go, really that simple.\nCruiser looks with e(asy)-bike simplicity make for an approachable, accessible bike for around town\nThrottle assist makes getting going from a stop sign a cinch\nHand-Holder e-bike specific handle on saddle makes moving the Shoreliner i/O much easier\nFully internal downtube battery provides generous 522Wh/14.5Ah capacity\nClassic raked fork complements cruiser styling\nClass 2 e-bike: throttle only or pedal assist up to 20mph\nBafang 350W motor",
